    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 英語版「Artemisia vulgaris」",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Artemisia_vulgaris",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 1349822848,
      "text": "Artemisia vulgaris, commonly known as mugwort, common mugwort, or wormwood, is a species of flowering plant in the daisy family Asteraceae. It is one of several species in the genus Artemisia commonly known as mugwort, although Artemisia vulgaris is the species most often called mugwort. Mugworts have been used medicinally and as culinary herbs."
    }
